{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10537","headline":"赴彭州山行之作 · 高适","name":"赴彭州山行之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峭壁连崆峒，攒峰叠翠微。\n鸟声堪驻马，林色可忘机。\n怪石时侵径，轻萝乍拂衣。\n路长愁作客，年老更思归。\n且悦岩峦胜，宁嗟意绪违。\n山行应未尽，谁与玩芳菲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10537.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10537","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}